# Description: Detects a TacticalRMM service installation. Tactical RMM is a remote monitoring & management tool.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((winlog.provider_name:"Service Control Manager" AND winlog.event_id:"7045") AND ((ImagePath:*tacticalrmm.exe*) OR (ServiceName:*TacticalRMM Agent Service*)))
